// Ch4 C4-03, the feast tables (optional): Osu, who keeps the wall. She has washed every shell on it
// for tonight, Asha's mother's twice. If ch02_heard_pila (Ch2's side scene at this wall), she tells
// Rhen quietly that he said hello to Teyo. Nothing here names the gap in the wall: C4-04 does.
title: ch04_wake_osu
location: ch04/haluna_wake
---
Osu [neutral]: Every shell on the wall, washed. Your mother's twice. She'd have wanted it done properly. #line:ch04_wake_osu_001
Asha [tender]: She would. Thank you, Osu. #line:ch04_wake_osu_002
<<if $ch02_heard_pila>>
Osu [soft_smile]: You said hello to him. Teyo. She told me. #line:ch04_wake_osu_003
Rhen [neutral]: It seemed rude not to. #line:ch04_wake_osu_004
<<endif>>
===
